<http://purl.org/saws/ontology#Marginalia> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Remark(s) physically written in the margin of the material by a scribe, not necessarily the original scribe. \n\nN.B. If a comment has been physically written on a material (usually in the margin), then this should be represented as an instance of Marginalia. The Comment class is for comments on a material that don’t physically exist on that material"@en .
