<http://purl.org/saws/ontology> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "Version 2.0. Produced after intensive discussions in Goettingen (September 2012) with SAWS project partners and various collaborators."@en .
<http://purl.org/saws/ontology> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Ontology for the Sharing Ancient Wisdoms (SAWS) project, to represent the information and knowledge available in medieval gnomologia (collections of wise sayings). SAWS concentrates mainly on Ancient Greek and Arabic manuscripts containing wisdom literature. All class descriptions are provided by domain experts and the ontology has been developed through collaboration between these experts and ontology developers."@en .
<http://purl.org/saws/ontology> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> "http://www.ancientwisdoms.ac.uk"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
