<http://purl.org/saws/ontology#isShorterVersionOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A LinguisticObject is related to another LinguisticObject in that it conveys the same ideas (FRBRoo: Work), but is expressed in a more concise version (FRBRoo: a different and shorter Expression)\n\nFor comparing between text of the same language, or comparing between different languages where the direction of translation is unknown or indirect"@en .
